# Pairs with ExpiredEventuallyPruned, under the fairness Spec asserts. The
# pass never returns to idle after its last delete, so a backup that expires
# later is never pruned.
MODULE: ExpiredEventuallyPrunedPassNeverEnds
TARGET: ExpiredEventuallyPruned
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the pass does not end after its last delete
PERTURBS: DelArt

--- FIND
    /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] = Settle(p, prDoomed[p] \ {m})]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the pass never ends.
    /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] = "delete"]
--- END